  <description
  >&lt;h2&gt;Add one working hour&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This demo uses a saved London OperatingHours record: &lt;b&gt;09:00-17:00, Monday-Friday&lt;/b&gt;, with &lt;b&gt;Monday 31 August 2026&lt;/b&gt; marked as a holiday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The default is &lt;b&gt;Friday 28 August at 16:30&lt;/b&gt;. Next calls the Chrono Working Time action to add one working hour: expect &lt;b&gt;Tuesday 1 September at 09:30&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Try choosing a weekend, the holiday, or a closed time: the picker offers the previous and next open time.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  <formulas>
